20
00:00:51,720 --> 00:00:53,240
Anansi won the stories,

21
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:55,940
which could now circulate among people.

22
00:00:55,940 --> 00:00:59,480
His small body carried a large proposition:

23
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:02,360
